{"id":"relais","lemma":"relais","pos":"noun","rank":3102,"glosses":["a horse (or team of horses) that transported a rider or coach etc from one staging post to another","a hotel that is used as a stop on long journeys","relay (electromechanical device)"],"ipa":"/ʁə.lɛ/","gender":"m","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-Relais.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tu peux prendre le relais ?","en":"Can you take over?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095676","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"La police a pris le relais.","en":"The police have taken over.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Tu veux que je prenne le relais ?","en":"Do you want me to take over?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je suis dans un relais routier.","en":"I'm at a truck stop.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"rutter"}]},{"text":"Prenez le relais.","en":"Take over.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}